```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor user as User
    participant cli as ctxt CLI
    participant ctxd as ctxd
    participant rec as Platform recorder<br/>(SCK / WASAPI / portal)
    participant policy as kit/policy
    participant bus as kit/bus
    participant cutter as Session cutter
    participant disk as Local media disk
    participant dp as dpkms
    participant pipe as audio.transcribe<br/>or video.full

    user->>cli: ctxt capture meeting start<br/>--label "Q3 planning"
    cli->>ctxd: gRPC: Meeting.Start
    ctxd->>bus: emit .requested
    bus->>policy: deliver
    policy-->>ctxd: allow
    ctxd->>cutter: ensure active session<br/>or open new
    cutter-->>ctxd: sess_xyz

    ctxd->>rec: configure capture (mode, target window)
    rec->>rec: OS permission prompt<br/>(first-time only)
    rec-->>ctxd: granted; bus emit .permission_granted

    ctxd->>bus: emit .started + .indicator_displayed
    rec->>rec: capture audio + video frames
    Note over rec,disk: 60 minutes pass...

    user->>cli: ctxt capture meeting stop
    cli->>ctxd: Meeting.Stop
    ctxd->>rec: stop
    rec->>disk: finalize file (.mov/.mp4/.webm)
    ctxd->>bus: emit .stopped (duration, bytes)

    ctxd->>dp: POST /api/v1/analyze<br/>file=path, pipeline=video.full,<br/>session_id=sess_xyz
    dp->>pipe: enqueue
    ctxd->>bus: emit .enqueued
    pipe->>pipe: extract audio → transcribe → diarize<br/>sample frames → OCR → assemble timeline
    pipe-->>dp: KnowledgeObject(transcript, sections, mentions)
    dp->>bus: emit .transcript_ready (KO id)

    Note over disk,dp: 48 hours later (retention TTL)
    ctxd->>disk: delete media file
    ctxd->>bus: emit .media_evicted

    user->>cli: ctxt session show sess_xyz
    cli->>dp: query: objects WHERE session_id=sess_xyz
    dp-->>user: meeting transcript + prep clipboard +<br/>browser visits + post-meeting file edits
```
